		(uuid "64960fad-76f8-4e6e-afb8-a9a43241d5a2")
	)
	(text_box "All RMII signals need to be routed using a 50 Ohm coplanar microstrip or stripline impedance profile:\n\nThe calculations for trace width have been made according to the manufacturing specs listed in the main architecture sheet of this PCB and assuming a coplanar routing approach (0.1mm clearance to GND).\n\nNote that the signal layers of this PCB are Layer 1, 4 and 6 and the reference layers are Layer 2 and 5. If this is changed, the trace width has to be recalculated.\n\nThe results of the JLCPCB online impedance caluclator are the following:\n\nLayer 1 trace width = 0.1199 mm\nLayer 4 trace width = 0.2149 mm\nLayer 6 trace width = 0.1199 mm\n\nThe impedance profiles will only be accurate if the following aspects are specified when ordering:\n\nLayers = 6\nInner copper weight = 0.5oz\nOuter copper weight = 1oz\nPCB thickness = 1.6mm\nManufacturer = JLCPCB\nStack-up Code = JLC0616H-3313A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 342.9 32.8422 0)
		(size -38.1 91.44)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87bca6f8-647d-4ee5-81e5-59d451e9ff50")
	)
	(text_box "Create a ground plane beneath the ethernet connector with the ETH_Shield net.\n\nTerminate ESD protection diodes to ETH_Shield plane.\n\nBond ETH_Shield to GND using ferrite beads at a single bonding point."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.84 111.5822 0)
		(size -45.72 22.86)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
